{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640050","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1064005001:0":{"text":"칠책이 말을 마치기도 전에 조개가 미친듯이 흔들렸다. 그리고 나는 심해로 끌려가지 않기 위해 낚싯대를 꽉 잡고 버텼다","source_cn":"齐尔查克的话音还没有落下，巨蚌就已经在疯狂摇动。你拿着...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1064005002:0":{"text":"다른 사람들도 급하게 달려와 페르세포네와 꼬리에 달린 거대한 조개와의 줄다리기에 합세했다","source_cn":"其他人见状也涌上前来帮忙，与冥湾美人和尾后的巨蚌展开了...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1064005003:1":{"text":"그렇게, 서로의 힘겨루기 끝에 결국 우리는 어딘가로 끌려가기 시작했다...","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1064005004:1":{"text":"그리고 넘실대는 파도를 타고 한참을 떠돌다가 어떤 섬의 얕은 해변에 좌초됐다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1064005005:1":{"text":"우리는 어쩔 수 없이 배에서 내려 쉬기로 했다","source_cn":"","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064005006:0":{"text":"음, 배가 크게 망가지진 않았어요. 밀물이 되면 다시 출항할 수 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"唔，船身好像没有太大损伤，等涨潮了应该就能离开。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9F1202A1F30F8920","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064005007:1":{"text":"페르세포네도 잡았으니까, 그동안의 노력이 헛수고는 아니네.","source_cn":"幸好冥湾美人被控制住了，不然之前的努力就白费了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAA78F02A021673","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064005008:1":{"text":"조개도 단단히 잘 물고 있군.","source_cn":"还附带了巨蚌。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFB2EB41E8339136D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064005009:1":{"text":"페르세포네의 간에 영향은 없겠지?","source_cn":"应该不会影响到冥湾美人的肝脏吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5ADFA5DEC39F71BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064005010:1":{"text":"내장이 다치진 않았을 걸세. 다만 손질할 때 조심해야겠지.","source_cn":"对内脏不会有损伤，只是处理的时候要小心。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24F139F352826074","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064005011:1":{"text":"...잠깐, 누가 너무 조용한 것 같지 않아?","source_cn":"……等等，总觉得以上对话中好像少了些什么。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE1689921277E838A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064005012:1":{"text":"아니, 조용한 게 아니라, 아예 없잖아?","source_cn":"或者说，少了个人？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x24F351C6B066EE76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064005013:1":{"text":"라이오스! 라이오스가 없어졌어!","source_cn":"啊！是莱欧斯！莱欧斯不见了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D7617CA12850C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1064005013":{"text":"라이오스! 라이오스가 없어졌어!","source_cn":"啊！是莱欧斯！莱欧斯不见了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD6D7617CA12850C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064005014:1":{"text":"젠장, 라이오스... 바다에 빠진 건 아니겠지?","source_cn":"糟糕，莱欧斯不会掉海里了吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x15E6CCFC2C224D57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064005015:1":{"text":"라이오스가 수영을 할 줄 알던가?","source_cn":"莱欧斯会游泳吧？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA270A1E75223DBB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064005016:1":{"text":"...바다에 빠졌으면 수영할 줄 안다고 해결될 문제가 아니잖아?!","source_cn":"……掉海里也不是会游泳能解决的吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF025E1427C0394E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064005017:1":{"text":"얼른 라이오스를 구해야 해!","source_cn":"得赶紧去救莱欧斯！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x382F702AE0ED7ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:23:1064005017":{"text":"얼른 라이오스를 구해야 해!","source_cn":"得赶紧去救莱欧斯！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x382F702AE0ED7ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064005018:0":{"text":"우리는 배와 주변의 얕은 해변을 돌며 라이오스를 찾았다.","source_cn":"你们分散开来，在船上和附近的浅滩上寻找莱欧斯的踪迹。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5B3068EC85B7C592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1064005019:1":{"text":"라이오스!","source_cn":"莱欧斯——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x72D0DEAC6B5D27F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1064005020:1":{"text":"라이오스, 어디 있는 거야?","source_cn":"莱欧斯，你在哪里？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x95A7A2235A7CFC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1064005021:1":{"text":"해변에는 흔적이 없네.","source_cn":"浅滩这里没有他的踪迹。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFB17813C770AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064005022:1":{"text":"배에도 없어요.","source_cn":"船上也没有。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5DCD01FD8EA23708","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064005023:0":{"text":"갑자기 멀리서 들려온 개 짖는 소리가 우리의 대화를 끊었다.","source_cn":"突然，远处传来一阵狗叫声，打断了你们的讨论。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFF4E7AB202168BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064005024:0":{"text":"저건... 개 짖는 소리?","source_cn":"那是……狗叫声？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF7AFF6BD77A3BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1064005025:0":{"text":"...이런 외딴 섬에 웬 개가?","source_cn":"……这种荒岛怎么会有狗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7EDDA5AED4F3E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:41:1064005025":{"text":"...이런 외딴 섬에 웬 개가?","source_cn":"……这种荒岛怎么会有狗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA7EDDA5AED4F3E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064005026:0":{"text":"우리는 개 짖는 소리를 따라 큰 나무 아래로 향했고","source_cn":"你们循着狗叫声，来到了一棵大树下。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x921A93E88590ED6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064005027:1":{"text":"커다란 흰색 사냥개 한 마리가 우리를 향해 “멍멍멍” 짖으며","source_cn":"而一只庞大的白毛猎犬，正在“汪汪汪汪汪”地朝你们狂吠着。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFC904C41CD459CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064005028:1":{"text":"꼬리를 흔들며 이빨을 드러내고 달려들었다!","source_cn":"随后，白毛猎犬疯狂地摇动着尾巴，呲着牙向你们狂奔而来。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CBC5A76425B8EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064005029:1":{"text":"어, 엄청 사나운 개잖아!","source_cn":"猎犬？！还有，也太凶暴了吧？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBAF440F3BFF7208C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064005030:1":{"text":"일단 도망쳐!","source_cn":"先跑了再说——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7F30F2DBD8A2CE09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064005031:1":{"text":"조심해. 쫓아온다!","source_cn":"小心，它马上追过来了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8DF6A5B6B55BC137","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1064005032:0":{"text":"으아아아, 이거나 먹어라!","source_cn":"啊啊啊啊啊——看招！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x892D8196E49199A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064005033:1":{"text":"마르실은 당황한 나머지 손에 들고 있던 마법책을 던졌고, 그 책은 사냥개의 머리를 정확하게 강타했다.","source_cn":"玛露西尔情急之下，将手中的魔法书扔了过去，正中猎犬的头部——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C94DD84D0DDCD2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064005034:1":{"text":"사냥개가 쓰러지자 은방울 같은 웃음소리가 울려 퍼지면서, 커다란 나비 날개를 단 타시가 허공에서 모습을 드러냈다.","source_cn":"猎犬应声倒地。同时，一阵银铃般的笑声响起，扇着巨大蝴蝶...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064005035:0":{"text":"하하하하, 정말 재미있어요. 최고의 하이라이트네요!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！太有趣了！好精彩的场面！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x79F17B94004EA671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:61:1064005035":{"text":"하하하하, 정말 재미있어요. 최고의 하이라이트네요!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈！太有趣了！好精彩的场面！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x79F17B94004EA671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1064005036:1":{"text":"그러니까... 이게 전부 다 저 녀석의... 장난이라고?","source_cn":"所以，这一切都是这位……搞的鬼？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA63BF007329B087","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064005037:0":{"text":"아마도요... 여러분, 이쪽은 장난을 좋아하는 꿈의 요정 타시예요.","source_cn":"应该是……各位，这是塔西，一个喜欢恶作剧的梦守妖精。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x50F2D3FAA8AD3A3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1064005038:1":{"text":"그럼 라이오스는 어디 간 거야?","source_cn":"我还以为莱欧斯也在呢……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE80EE89C240266F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1064005039:0":{"text":"아이 참, 여러분. 이 사냥개를 자세히 보세요!","source_cn":"哎呀，你们再仔细看看那个猎犬嘛！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4234D9C905733AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1064005040:0":{"text":"어? 사냥개가... 아니, 라이오스가 쓰러져 있어!","source_cn":"咦？狗不见了……等等，莱欧斯倒下了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC7928B3F14D75C01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1064005041:0":{"text":"으윽… 머리야…","source_cn":"唔……头好痛。<key:dialog64>","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4710873F14A541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:73:1064005042:0":{"text":"아, 미안해. 라이오스! 너인 줄 몰랐어!","source_cn":"啊，对不起，莱欧斯！我不知道那是你！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB323BBD8D79BF0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:74:1064005042":{"text":"아, 미안해. 라이오스! 너인 줄 몰랐어!","source_cn":"啊，对不起，莱欧斯！我不知道那是你！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB323BBD8D79BF0B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1064005043:0":{"text":"전 사과 안 할 거예요. 누군가의 꿈에서 나온 모습을 투영했을 뿐이거든요.","source_cn":"我才不要道歉呢，我只是投射了某个人梦境中的形象而已。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x9B1410B1405F7F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1064005044:0":{"text":"전 손도 대지 않았다구요!","source_cn":"我可没直接动手！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0x113636EBB78950E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:79:1064005045:0":{"text":"...무슨 일이 있었던 거지? 난 분명 페르세포네를 타고 인어를 쫓고 있었는데?","source_cn":"……发生了什么？我不是骑在了冥湾美人身上追人鱼吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7E5230317EB347","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:80:1064005046:0":{"text":"저기, 그게...","source_cn":"那个……呃……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x74294B7DCFB7F329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1064005047:0":{"text":"머리가 좀 아파. 뭔가 무거운 게 머리에 떨어진 기분이야.","source_cn":"但我的头有点痛，感觉是被什么重物砸中了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x499BF991DBC73442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:82:1064005047":{"text":"머리가 좀 아파. 뭔가 무거운 게 머리에 떨어진 기분이야.","source_cn":"但我的头有点痛，感觉是被什么重物砸中了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x499BF991DBC73442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:83:1064005048:0":{"text":"그렇구나!","source_cn":"原来如此啊！","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xF45319E7E3A902AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1064005049:1":{"text":"몸은 괜찮은 것 같으니 그냥 넘어가자...","source_cn":"人看起来没事，就让这件事这么过去吧……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x27FD4C3656F38844","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1064005050:1":{"text":"음... 뭔가 이상한 느낌인데...","source_cn":"唔……好像哪里还是不太对劲……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD9DE83677B200A25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:87:1064005051:1":{"text":"아직 머리 많이 아파? 내가 마법으로 빨리 치료해 줄까?!","source_cn":"头还在痛吗？要不要我用魔法帮你回复下？回复的速度我可是...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:88:1064005052:1":{"text":"아니! 괜찮아!","source_cn":"不用！完全用不着！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x2D897399D1D2C12A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1064005053:1":{"text":"이 느낌은... 배고파! 꿈에서 한참 뛰어다닌 것도 체력이 소모되나?","source_cn":"啊！这种感觉是——饿了！梦里的追逐战也会消耗体力吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9434989DAE8FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:90:1064005053":{"text":"이 느낌은... 배고파! 꿈에서 한참 뛰어다닌 것도 체력이 소모되나?","source_cn":"啊！这种感觉是——饿了！梦里的追逐战也会消耗体力吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBA9434989DAE8FF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1064005054:1":{"text":"꿈이고 뭐고! 라이오스가 배고프다고 하니까 일단 밥부터 할까? 마침 재료도 있잖아!","source_cn":"别管做梦了！莱欧斯已经饿了，总之我们现在开始做饭吧？手...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:92:1064005055:1":{"text":"...화제 전환이 너무 갑작스러운 거 아니냐고.","source_cn":"……转折也太生硬了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFC19DA89A924BC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1064005056:0":{"text":"뭐, 나도 배가 좀 고프긴 해.","source_cn":"不过，我也有点饿了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE8DC6D9C507E8927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1064005057:0":{"text":"그래서 뭘 만들 건가요?","source_cn":"所以你们要做什么吃呢？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7FC9CA4FD853948","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1064005058:0":{"text":"여러분의 꿈에서 다양한 마물 요리를 봤어요!","source_cn":"我在你们的梦境里看到了各种各样的魔物料理！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE7ECE58F19C9170A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:97:1064005059:0":{"text":"저도 먹고 싶어요. 진짜 먹어보고 싶어요. 꼭 먹을 거예요!","source_cn":"我好馋，我想吃，我要吃到！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9F4236EB0B86B442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:99:1064005060:1":{"text":"젓가락 하나 더 놓는 것 정도야 일도 아닐세.","source_cn":"老夫倒是不介意多准备一副碗筷。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x9E3E647C50C7B158","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:100:1064005061:0":{"text":"하지만 먼저 식재료가 안전한지 확인부터 해야겠지.","source_cn":"不过首先要确保食材的安全程度。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x88B3E9220CFF1EB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1064005062:1":{"text":"걱정 마세요. 생으로 먹어도 되는 것들이거든요!","source_cn":"放心吧，这些都可以直接生吃！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD3BEB9EADCD466BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:103:1064005063:1":{"text":"...생으로 먹는 건 좀 그렇지 않을까? 식중독은 진짜 괴롭거든.","source_cn":"……还是不要生吃了吧，食物中毒的感觉太差了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x12B4FED312938372","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:105:1064005064:1":{"text":"그건 기생충을 생으로 먹어서 그런 거잖아. 해산물이랑은 달라!","source_cn":"你那是生吃寄生虫，和生吃海鲜完全不一样吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xED7DE0BD46721216","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:107:1064005065:0":{"text":"그럼 이번에는 해산물 죽으로 먹어보지.","source_cn":"那么，这次就做海鲜粥吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4C0FF50BD5F6D4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:108:1064005066:0":{"text":"페르세포네의 간은 꺼내서 따로 보관하고, 나머지 부분은 모두 솥에 넣겠네.","source_cn":"老夫先把冥湾美人的肝脏取出保存，其余的部分就用在锅里吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xDBFF542501A8CB5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:110:1064005067:0":{"text":"먼저 쌀을 물과 함께 솥에 넣어서 푹 끓이고...","source_cn":"先将生米放在锅中加水煮沸。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3E0B9E344A1079B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_reco